22	// DEVDESK-753, lot 2, steps 3 and 4 (and the state side of step 5): the preview
23	// of the change is computed by a Cmd the detail starts when it opens, stored by
24	// Update, and read from the model by the header, ctrl+o and the Fix line. No test
